    "text": "from typing import List\n\ndef intersperse(\n    numbers: List[int], del: int) -> List[int]:\n    \"\"\" Inserting a number `delimeter` between every two consecutive elements of the input list `numbers`.\n    >>> intersperse([], 4)\n    []\n    >>> intersperse([1, 2, 3], 4)\n    [1, 4, 2, 4, 3]\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    for num in numbers:\n        if num:\n            result.append(num)\n        result.append(del)\n    return result\n\n# Test cases\nimport doctest\ndoctest.testmod()\n\n```\n\nThis code",
